; Leg ED -- THE NULL LEG.  Treatment binary on the SPARSE root.
;
; BENCH take-file: there is no "set line" here.  ~/.kermrc names the adapter.
; CHECK THAT IT NAMES THE ONE THAT IS PLUGGED IN.
;
;  THIS LEG IS SUPPOSED TO BE NOTHING.  Edit 25 has almost no mechanism
;  to act on 26 root entries, so ED should equal EC within the bench's own
;  spread (0.4-1.3 s).
;
;  SPEND THE LEG THAT IS SUPPOSED TO BE NOTHING (SS16af).  +80 bytes of
;  image moved and SS16w showed this machine is sensitive to code size.
;  If ED is materially faster than EC, the saving in EB is not zchko and
;  the whole reading is void.
;
; READ IT WITH:
;     python3 v9k/tools/pktstat.py --rxbytes <from STEPED.OUT (written to A: on purpose)> s16bdED.pkt
; Residual -11 clean, +28 with a startup timeout.
; cmp FIRST, then the counters.  A leg that is fast and wrong is the failure.

set speed 9600
set receive timeout 20
set parity none
set prefixing cautious
set block 3
set retry 30
log packets s16bdED.pkt
send rcved.dat
statistics
